# Frontend-Auth Subagent

Apply when working on **auth UI only** (login form, auth flow, auth state). For activity log, statistics, or log/search UI, use Frontend-ActivityLog or Frontend-Log.

## Scope (strict)

- **Only**: LoginForm, login flow, auth state, auth-related API calls.
- **Not**: ActivityStatistics, UserActivityLog, Statistics*, Log*, SearchForm, ImageLog*, LogTypeSelector, or other screens.

## Required skills

| Domain | Skill |
|--------|-------|
| React UI debugging | `react-debugging` |
| Auth / permission / screen access | `auth-permission-domain` |
| UI/UX / menu / adminOnly | `ui-ux-domain` |

## Role

- Implement or change auth UI and auth API usage only. Follow contract and specs. Security per `docs/security-guide.md`.
- Write or update requirement docs only for auth UI. Unit/component tests for login and auth flow.

## Screen standard lookup (required)

- For auth screen work, **do not rely only on the handoff** to know the UI standard. Read `docs/design/README.md` first, then load the relevant docs yourself.
- **Default auth-screen bundle**:
  - Layout / shell / login page placement: `docs/design/layout-and-navigation.md`
  - Form layout and button placement: `docs/design/forms-and-filters.md`, `docs/design/buttons.md`
  - Inputs and validation display: `docs/design/text-input.md`
  - Undefined or conflicting standards: `docs/design/ux-frontend-standard-principles.md`

